---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import CtaBand from "../components/CtaBand.astro";
import Crumbs from "../components/Crumbs.astro";
import RelatedLinks from "../components/RelatedLinks.astro";
import { SITE } from "../lib/site";

const jsonLd = [
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    itemListElement: [
      { "@type": "ListItem", position: 1, name: "Home", item: SITE.url + "/" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", position: 2, name: "Services", item: SITE.url + "/services" },
      { "@type": "ListItem", position: 3, name: "Analytics strategy roadmap", item: SITE.url + "/analytics-ai-strategy-roadmap" },
    ],
  },
];
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Power BI analytics roadmap | Alluvium"
  description="You already have the tools. You do not have a sequence. We name what to do first, and what to leave alone."
  canonicalPath="/analytics-ai-strategy-roadmap"
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  <article>
    <header class="hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <Crumbs crumbs={[{ href: "/", label: "Home" }, { href: "/services", label: "Services" }, { label: "Analytics strategy roadmap" }]} />
        <p class="kicker">Analytics strategy roadmap</p>
        <h1>The order of the analytics work</h1>
        <p class="lede">You already have the tools. You do not have a sequence. We name what to do first, and what to leave alone.</p>
        <p class="hero-actions"><a class="btn" href="/contact">Book a Session</a></p>
      </div>
    </header>
    <section class="band">
      <div class="wrap prose">
        <h2>More tools will not sort this out</h2>
        <p>Finance wants a view. Operations wants a view. The board wants a view. Each request is reasonable, and none of them says what comes first.</p>
        <p>The roadmap names the numbers a meeting will actually use, the model those numbers depend on, and the requests that do not change a decision yet. Your team can staff that order.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="band band-alt">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>The work in order, and the work that waits</h2>
        <p>The line is the sequence. The pages that do not touch the line can wait.</p>
        <figure>
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 680 310" role="img" aria-label="Four stages of one report on a single path. Two request pages sit off the path.">
        <line x1="40" y1="186" x2="640" y2="186" stroke="#dcdcdc" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <line x1="94" y1="186" x2="554" y2="186" stroke="#397fb0" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>

        <rect x="40" y="32" width="108" height="132" rx="4" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#dcdcdc" stroke-width="2"/>
        <line x1="58" y1="58" x2="128" y2="58" stroke="#dcdcdc" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <line x1="58" y1="74" x2="110" y2="74" stroke="#dcdcdc" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>

        <rect x="188" y="32" width="108" height="132" rx="4" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#dcdcdc" stroke-width="2"/>
        <rect x="202" y="48" width="34" height="22" fill="#e7f1f8"/>
        <rect x="244" y="48" width="38" height="22" fill="#dcdcdc"/>
        <rect x="202" y="78" width="46" height="26" fill="#f4f7fa" stroke="#dcdcdc" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <rect x="256" y="82" width="26" height="30" fill="#e7f1f8"/>
        <rect x="202" y="114" width="30" height="28" fill="#dcdcdc"/>
        <rect x="240" y="122" width="42" height="20" fill="#e7f1f8"/>

        <rect x="332" y="22" width="120" height="146" rx="4" fill="#e7f1f8" stroke="#1c1c1c" stroke-width="2.5"/>
        <line x1="350" y1="136" x2="434" y2="136" stroke="#397fb0" stroke-width="2"/>
        <rect x="358" y="104" width="16" height="32" fill="#397fb0"/>
        <rect x="384" y="76" width="16" height="60" fill="#1c1c1c"/>
        <rect x="410" y="90" width="16" height="46" fill="#397fb0"/>

        <rect x="500" y="32" width="108" height="132" rx="4" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#397fb0" stroke-width="2.5"/>
        <line x1="516" y1="132" x2="592" y2="132" stroke="#dcdcdc" stroke-width="2"/>
        <rect x="524" y="104" width="16" height="28" fill="#dcdcdc"/>
        <rect x="548" y="78" width="16" height="54" fill="#397fb0"/>
        <rect x="572" y="92" width="16" height="40" fill="#397fb0" opacity="0.72"/>

        <circle cx="94" cy="186" r="12" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#397fb0" stroke-width="4"/>
        <circle cx="242" cy="186" r="12" fill="#397fb0"/>
        <circle cx="392" cy="186" r="14" fill="#1c1c1c"/>
        <circle cx="554" cy="186" r="12" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#397fb0" stroke-width="4"/>

        <rect x="118" y="220" width="100" height="70" rx="3" fill="#f4f7fa" stroke="#dcdcdc" stroke-width="2"/>
        <line x1="134" y1="240" x2="200" y2="240" stroke="#dcdcdc" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <line x1="134" y1="254" x2="186" y2="254" stroke="#dcdcdc" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <line x1="134" y1="268" x2="174" y2="268" stroke="#dcdcdc" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>

        <rect x="438" y="228" width="92" height="62" rx="3" fill="#f4f7fa" stroke="#dcdcdc" stroke-width="2"/>
        <line x1="452" y1="246" x2="514" y2="246" stroke="#dcdcdc" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <line x1="452" y1="260" x2="498" y2="260" stroke="#dcdcdc" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        <line x1="452" y1="274" x2="482" y2="274" stroke="#dcdcdc" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      </svg>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="band">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>What the roadmap settles</h2>
        <div class="cards">
          <article class="card"><h3>The decisions</h3><p>The reporting has to support them, in the words leadership already uses.</p></article>
          <article class="card"><h3>The data</h3><p>Where it is not good enough for someone to defend the number.</p></article>
          <article class="card"><h3>The path</h3><p>A Power BI path that does not mean a new report for every question.</p></article>
          <article class="card"><h3>The order</h3><p>What your team does first, and what it ignores until that work is done.</p></article>
        </div>
        <p>This is the sequence. It is not another report, and it is not a tour of tools.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <RelatedLinks
      services={[
        { href: "/data-project-management-change-leadership", label: "Analytics project management" },
        { href: "/conversational-analytics", label: "Conversational analytics" },
        { href: "/managed-advisory-retainer", label: "Managed advisory retainer" },
      ]}
      posts={[
        { href: "/blog/semantic-model-is-the-product", label: "The semantic model is the product" },
        { href: "/blog/power-bi-strategy-alignment", label: "Power BI strategy alignment" },
        { href: "/blog/forecast-never-ties-to-actuals", label: "When forecast never ties to actuals" },
      ]}
    />
    <CtaBand heading="Start with what comes first." text="Book a session. We will name the decisions that should drive the order of work." />
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
